{"id":"1bbdc339-3baa-4338-a1c8-804335262102","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || clazz.getMethods().length == 0","rationale":"If result is empty, then clazz probably has no methods (or at least none matching the filter). The empty result list corresponds to no matching methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.metadata.definition.util.ClassUtils#getPublicNonStaticMethods(Class<?>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/metadata/definition/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:16:45.686796710Z"}
