{"id":"a72dfc8e-7425-46ab-b7f4-9538021e77dd","expr":"methodName != null && !methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Since the method fetches models by methodName, methodName being non-null and non-empty is meaningful here.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.rpc.model.ProviderModel#getMethodModel(String,String[]):ProviderMethodModel","file":"org/apache/dubbo/rpc/model/ProviderModel.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:16:54.797450054Z"}
