{"id":"08cbdff8-78fe-44b8-98f1-722b41894f9b","expr":"srcSize == 0 || srcIdx < srcBytes.length","rationale":"If there is data to decode, srcIdx has to be within srcBytes array bounds.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.Utf8Utils#decodeUtf8(byte[],int,int,char[],int):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/Utf8Utils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:00.803491809Z"}
