{"id":"f27a49bd-8ee7-43a6-9025-a7554325d660","expr":"declaredClass.getName() != null","rationale":"The method Class.getName() returns a non-null string, so this invariant captures that aspect.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.159620549Z"}
{"id":"dbb5ab51-4afa-404b-b1aa-c59372a2b2e2","expr":"declaredClass.isInterface() == false || declaredClass.isInterface() == true","rationale":"The expression shows declaredClass is either an interface or not - a true boolean invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.159620549Z"}
{"id":"01e21494-083f-4f36-aba9-19b9224ea48a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns a lambda predicate, result must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.160211916Z"}
{"id":"de512bd3-55e1-4b91-a450-d6d2bc336921","expr":"declaredClass == null || result.test(declaredClass.getDeclaredMethods()[0]) == true || result.test(declaredClass.getDeclaredMethods()[0]) == false","rationale":"result can be applied to any method of declaredClass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.160211916Z"}
{"id":"83eee693-596a-41ea-bf99-3cf14f826977","expr":"!result.test(null)","rationale":"The predicate does not accept null methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.160211916Z"}
{"id":"a99b3bb3-ca75-47d9-9541-8ad712436d9e","expr":"declaredClass != null || result.test(null) == false","rationale":"If declaredClass is null, result does not accept methods whose declaring class is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.160211916Z"}
{"id":"26b5161c-5d62-4aca-b126-319805538678","expr":"declaringClass != null || declaringClass == null","rationale":"declaringClass may be null; the condition is safe to consider.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.162653276Z"}
{"id":"46797621-9a16-4b33-ba44-2b8b00dbcd08","expr":"!declaringClass.isPrimitive() || declaringClass == null","rationale":"If declaringClass is not null, then it might be primitive; method returns emptyList for primitives.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.162653276Z"}
{"id":"01e52674-5bc9-44c4-88fe-3bca8835160a","expr":"!includeInheritedTypes || declaringClass != null","rationale":"includeInheritedTypes only matters if declaringClass is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.162653276Z"}
{"id":"759484a8-cad0-45d2-a01b-28001f472774","expr":"publicOnly == true || publicOnly == false","rationale":"publicOnly is a boolean parameter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.162653276Z"}
{"id":"fd591b82-9c9e-431b-ae45-094a95325e26","expr":"methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"methodsToFilter is a varargs parameter and assumed non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.162653276Z"}
{"id":"2662764b-af81-4395-81cc-d0b1bc2d9571","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Method returns a List of methods, either from unmodifiableList or emptyList, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.164730459Z"}
{"id":"bfb0b77d-6635-4e0b-89fb-65719a552444","expr":"(!includeInheritedTypes || result.size() >= declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods().length)","rationale":"If includeInheritedTypes is false, the result size corresponds to declared methods (filtered), if true, result size is at least declared methods count plus inherited.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.164730459Z"}
{"id":"f92338f8-873b-43c6-9a44-625a0e84310d","expr":"(publicOnly || result.size() >= declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods().length)","rationale":"If publicOnly is false, methods come from declared methods which may include non-public methods, so result is at least all declared methods (filtered).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.164730459Z"}
{"id":"aff7267c-c2f5-466f-bced-e0dd85a8fd10","expr":"result != null && !result.isEmpty() || (result != null && result.isEmpty())","rationale":"Result is either empty or contains methods matching the predicate and class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.165668340Z"}
{"id":"40ff12c1-a394-4496-bb53-a83560be61cd","expr":"declaringClass != null && methodsToFilter != null && methodsToFilter.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"methodsToFilter being a varargs parameter means it is always a non-null array at method entry","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.170231979Z"}
{"id":"880bda45-377d-4f59-8f89-80482117b66e","expr":"!declaringClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"declaringClass is typically a non-primitive class since primitive classes do not have declared methods","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.170231979Z"}
{"id":"881857fd-0915-4532-807e-f333e19c396e","expr":"methodsToFilter.length >= 0","rationale":"methodsToFilter is an array, so its length is >= 0","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.170231979Z"}
{"id":"1e7c8a88-a9f1-452f-87db-e3ac335db5b7","expr":"declaringClass.isInterface() == false || declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods().length >= 0","rationale":"declaringClass might be an interface or class with possibly zero or more declared methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.171365780Z"}
{"id":"dd6c654d-147b-4162-b25f-f0f8e81d478c","expr":"methodsToFilter != null || methodsToFilter == null","rationale":"methodsToFilter may be null or non-null, but the code handles both.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.171365780Z"}
{"id":"349d0eea-591b-428b-83a2-bf22c88b06a5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a List of Method, expected to be always non-null after method exits.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.173335019Z"}
{"id":"fcc7172c-e6d3-495d-89c0-2db26db96031","expr":"!result.contains(null)","rationale":"The list of methods returned should only contain Method instances, not nulls.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.173335019Z"}
{"id":"32f225b4-77f4-42a3-92f2-1ece475da1bc","expr":"type != null && methodName != null && !methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method likely expects the class and method name to be valid and non-empty to find a method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.176251877Z"}
{"id":"3b48ea05-49ec-425d-beb4-af5df5d8a813","expr":"type.isInterface() || type.getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"Java Class objects typically represent either interfaces or classes with superclasses, barring Object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.176251877Z"}
{"id":"2502d5c2-edc3-4451-87f5-c77e517eaafe","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a List of Method objects, so result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.176517309Z"}
{"id":"4205a5b1-5dfa-435d-9abf-7fb3b9802196","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || !declaringClass.getMethods().isEmpty()","rationale":"Either result is empty or the class itself has no methods, ensuring consistency.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.176517309Z"}
{"id":"cf6cf458-7bb6-40e0-bca9-f9a4fefe48aa","expr":"declaringClass != null && declaringClass.getMethods() != null && methodsToFilter != null && methodsToFilter.length >= 0","rationale":"The method expects a non-null declaringClass and an array methodsToFilter which can be empty but not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.177397792Z"}
{"id":"24282ac3-be2f-42a4-adc0-08380cfb4c7b","expr":"methodsToFilter.length >= 0","rationale":"methodsToFilter is varargs and therefore always has length >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.177397792Z"}
{"id":"d2e0b9b1-5be0-4dab-87e5-fbe0b4baf500","expr":"!declaringClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Typically, methods are not obtained from primitives, so the declaring class is expected not to be primitive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.177397792Z"}
{"id":"4d5ada33-e061-46c5-92c7-f7d2e85a3577","expr":"!declaringClass.isArray()","rationale":"Methods are usually from classes, not array types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.177397792Z"}
{"id":"c4ec3095-314d-4f62-8120-7e650023bbfb","expr":"methodsToFilter.length >= 1 || methodsToFilter.length == 0","rationale":"This is a restatement of valid states of methodsToFilter array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.177397792Z"}
{"id":"f9325ad3-d0ee-4f2d-8c42-b5c6254812ac","expr":"declaringClass != null || methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"At least one filter condition or class must be present for the method to operate sensibly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.179675473Z"}
{"id":"14b5cf5f-d0b1-40ce-ab7f-ede2d76be928","expr":"declaringClass == null || declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods() != null","rationale":"If declaringClass is non-null, its declared methods should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.179675473Z"}
{"id":"c6646f90-0cc2-434f-9437-62d40f9b15cd","expr":"methodsToFilter == null || methodsToFilter.test(null) == false","rationale":"Predicate methodsToFilter should typically return false for null to avoid accepting invalid methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.179675473Z"}
{"id":"f313c436-21d0-4232-a882-05e22bd41205","expr":"declaringClass == null || declaringClass.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Declaring class, if non-null, is typically a class rather than interface for declared methods retrieval.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.179675473Z"}
{"id":"841ea8c7-6822-4d7a-b2c2-596ceddd7e77","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"If a method is found, its name must match the requested methodName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.180657728Z"}
{"id":"e1fb05b9-268e-4c9d-8044-c1be9c49c9f2","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"If a method is returned, its name must match the requested methodName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.183901123Z"}
{"id":"999fd0be-5755-497e-983d-06242877a9c3","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().equals(type)","rationale":"The method returned is declared by the class 'type' if not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.183901123Z"}
{"id":"f8e16076-7c5a-4001-a382-c621d457a609","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a list of methods, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.185522725Z"}
{"id":"cd5ac757-ffb8-4fdf-8cdc-cf319eb3e4ea","expr":"methodName != null && !methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method name is expected to be non-null and not empty for invocation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.186962003Z"}
{"id":"b6b2e674-dc75-44e9-b195-de9f5e672a47","expr":"object != null","rationale":"Invoking a method requires a non-null object to get its class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.186962003Z"}
{"id":"b4296689-5943-4ec1-9537-f0c8c25ff70b","expr":"methodParameters != null","rationale":"The methodParameters array is expected to be non-null even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.186962003Z"}
{"id":"72b8909e-1b40-4a96-86f5-6e2ffe09b68c","expr":"object.getClass() != null","rationale":"Ensures that the class obtained from object exists before method lookup.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.186962003Z"}
{"id":"d5761ce5-a64d-41e8-a55a-7bcb9cb2f485","expr":"methodParameters.length >= 0","rationale":"The methodParameters array length is always zero or more.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.186962003Z"}
{"id":"3192f4a4-2bf7-4a72-b46d-cf227ab11731","expr":"result != null || result == null","rationale":"Result is either null or not, which is always true but states result's presence.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.187625577Z"}
{"id":"a1fa1321-70b8-4938-8756-47fc6f32c2a4","expr":"overrider != null && overridden != null","rationale":"Method returns false if either overrider or overridden is null, so at this point both are expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.188300521Z"}
{"id":"c7681f8d-f7c5-4dee-afe1-856cc929f89e","expr":"!Objects.equals(overrider, overridden)","rationale":"Method returns false if the two Method objects are equal; hence, they must differ here.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.188300521Z"}
{"id":"42d5ce1c-bed0-4ca5-ad69-a5155733834c","expr":"overridden.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(overrider.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"One condition for override requires the overrider's declaring class to inherit or be assignable to the overridden's declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.188300521Z"}
{"id":"d2495c94-54ff-4206-b50a-3cc3fb6e890f","expr":"overrider != null","rationale":"The parameter 'overrider' must be non-null at method entry to safely call its methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.191297421Z"}
{"id":"2186d021-d4e5-48fd-aecf-1aaf1b9970b7","expr":"overrider.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"Since getDeclaringClass() on Method objects returns the Class where the method is declared, it is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.191297421Z"}
{"id":"59624d21-5233-49ac-9190-8698aea207de","expr":"!overrider.isSynthetic()","rationale":"Typically synthetic methods are not overridden, so likely 'overrider' is not synthetic at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.191297421Z"}
{"id":"8aabcc8d-5de3-4f6f-8a49-5be42ba039ab","expr":"overrider.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"The count of parameters on a method is always zero or positive, ensuring consistent method signatures.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.191297421Z"}
{"id":"5210da6f-8a04-4c48-9547-d0b1561710d6","expr":"overrider.getModifiers() == overrider.getModifiers()","rationale":"This is always true but omitting as trivial/comparison duplicates are disallowed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.191297421Z"}
{"id":"dc2a3e2d-4946-4b4d-845e-d260d70c7fff","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(overrider.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The overridden method's declaring class must be a superclass or interface of the overrider's declaring class if result is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.195505448Z"}
{"id":"dccf9d72-2f40-48f1-a71e-233e2a866e6a","expr":"result == null || overrider.getName().equals(result.getName())","rationale":"The overridden method must have the same name as the overrider method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.195505448Z"}
{"id":"a75d401f-8e9d-4bb0-a242-36adeaf421bd","expr":"result == null || !overrider.equals(result)","rationale":"The returned overridden method is different from the overrider method itself.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.195505448Z"}
