{"id":"bbf59229-5804-41cc-a8b7-d54f9e988fb6","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2classArray(String):Class<?>[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.695390692Z"}
{"id":"1abff080-37a5-486f-ba54-2e34299665f9","expr":"desc != null && desc.length() >= 0","rationale":"desc is a String parameter, so it is non-null and length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2classArray(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.697926160Z"}
{"id":"603ff6ca-05d6-4cfb-b43c-bdad5c6ad53e","expr":"desc.length() == 0 || desc.length() > 0","rationale":"desc.length() must be zero or positive because desc is non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2classArray(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.697926160Z"}
{"id":"e4f20318-e9e7-4506-8cf7-3c002cb673d6","expr":"! (desc.length() == 0 && cl == null)","rationale":"If desc is empty, cl being null is not necessarily problematic but this expresses at least one is meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2classArray(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.697926160Z"}
{"id":"e38ec441-07ba-41a4-add2-c4cb988cdb09","expr":"clazz != null && methodName != null && (parameterTypes == null || parameterTypes.length >= 0)","rationale":"The method requires clazz and methodName non-null to proceed. parameterTypes can be null indicating method with any parameters or non-null with the parameter count.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.709412722Z"}
{"id":"6d1437ad-69f0-4fd8-8aa1-8e9c5835cbc6","expr":"clazz.isInterface() == false || clazz.isAnonymousClass() == false","rationale":"Finding methods usually applies meaningfully on classes, this avoids pathological cases; though not strictly enforced, it is common usage.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.709412722Z"}
{"id":"eba155a9-0dda-413e-b62f-5f97e76ed8bc","expr":"methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"A valid method name is expected to be non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.709412722Z"}
{"id":"6f66005a-75b7-415a-84d1-c72f408079fe","expr":"parameterTypes == null || methodName != null","rationale":"Method signature requires methodName to be non-null if parameterTypes is specified; overall methodName is required.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.709412722Z"}
{"id":"fe8ff5ee-ca87-49c7-bdb4-0545fb28e004","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"The input descriptor is expected to be non-null and non-empty for the method to operate meaningfully.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2classArray(String):Class<?>[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.710703049Z"}
{"id":"e989d529-682e-4cad-bf13-9615b06a8619","expr":"desc == null || desc.length() >= 2","rationale":"If desc is non-null, it is expected to meet minimum length requirements for a valid descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2classArray(String):Class<?>[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.710703049Z"}
{"id":"d63772c0-1d3b-4cc7-b690-ab31fca0a15d","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a Class object representing the Java type described by desc, so result is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2class(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.711557433Z"}
{"id":"97a9c81f-0d0d-44e4-8f51-f84fbee39468","expr":"result != null","rationale":"result is returned from toArray, which never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2classArray(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.715191525Z"}
{"id":"9f184c6a-7c8f-404c-a3e9-c2e5e4c2591c","expr":"(desc.length() == 0) == (result.length == 0)","rationale":"When desc is empty, result is EMPTY_CLASS_ARRAY which has length 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2classArray(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.715191525Z"}
{"id":"2b38e744-de48-467b-bb31-dffdde5e27e3","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"Java arrays always have non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2classArray(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.715191525Z"}
{"id":"aa925972-b75b-4524-9a4f-bf4fafa1fd2c","expr":"(!desc.isEmpty()) || (result.length == 0)","rationale":"When desc is empty string, method returns EMPTY_CLASS_ARRAY which is empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#desc2classArray(ClassLoader,String):Class<?>[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.715191525Z"}
{"id":"278d7b37-8bac-4bed-8476-7c5831374d15","expr":"result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"Since the method returned by findMethodByMethodSignature must match methodName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.716271906Z"}
{"id":"12544675-f69a-40e8-a7d4-0b358e5a7303","expr":"result.getDeclaringClass().equals(clazz)","rationale":"The returned Method belongs to the input Class clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.716271906Z"}
{"id":"603a3e61-7417-4a81-801b-aa04feb1eae3","expr":"(! (parameterTypes != null)) || (result.getParameterCount() == parameterTypes.length)","rationale":"When parameterTypes is non-null, the found method's parameter list length equals parameterTypes length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.716271906Z"}
{"id":"3df33830-365f-49ce-8d9d-8c2ca58f4f47","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a non-null Method object when it does not throw.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.716271906Z"}
{"id":"ae481325-ef9e-4be6-9465-3b83c98a51fa","expr":"methodName != null && methodName.length() > 0 && clazz != null","rationale":"The method expects non-null class and methodName, with methodName not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.730536094Z"}
{"id":"5afa8076-2861-4f9e-b601-1ab90a3b7fcb","expr":"clazz != null && (methodName != null && !methodName.isEmpty())","rationale":"To ensure inputs are valid, clazz and methodName should be non-null and methodName non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.730536094Z"}
{"id":"13a8f984-2f5c-4445-a3dd-abea98a0e0d4","expr":"result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"The method returns a Method whose name equals the methodName parameter","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.752304634Z"}
{"id":"312192ea-3faf-4ef2-aaaf-0222bc98788b","expr":"result == null || result.getParameterTypes()[0].isAssignableFrom(paramType)","rationale":"Ensures the parameter compatibility that led to the constructor being selected.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Constructor<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.752439659Z"}
{"id":"bd83d0d1-fdad-41a5-9fef-b06c7f4301f3","expr":"clazz.isAssignableFrom(result.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The declaring class of the returned method is assignable from the input clazz","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.752304634Z"}
{"id":"93dbfe66-1f33-4be0-91f0-e7a5760659cf","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned method is not null because the method would throw if no method was found","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.752304634Z"}
{"id":"44ffc93b-3ae3-429c-8b4d-f0aacdb36527","expr":"result.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"The parameter count of the returned method is nonnegative","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.752304634Z"}
{"id":"b18bdf9e-d747-427f-9c33-2f75664496c6","expr":"clazz != null && paramType != null && clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"The method entry implies that clazz and paramType are input parameters and thus non-null or valid. clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz) checks a basic class relationship that always holds.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Constructor<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.753813202Z"}
{"id":"c0963978-77d6-4dcc-bf13-03987a25733e","expr":"paramType.isAssignableFrom(paramType)","rationale":"Class objects are always assignable from themselves, so this invariant holds at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Constructor<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.753813202Z"}
{"id":"73b1d4ad-4e97-432b-a54d-93055fd10afc","expr":"clazz.getConstructors().length >= 0","rationale":"The constructors array length is always >= 0, a property of arrays in Java.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Constructor<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.753813202Z"}
{"id":"b8bd9440-2938-4ba9-8f8e-3218728018e8","expr":"level >= 0 && level <= 3","rationale":"Level parameter is used as recursion depth and constrained to a max of 2.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.779181491Z"}
{"id":"7101d821-7793-43cf-8bb2-fc8641c619e2","expr":"emptyInstances != null","rationale":"Map parameter is expected non-null to store empty instances.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.779181491Z"}
{"id":"8a2dd8a5-8d55-4cd4-bf0b-f68f06422c2e","expr":"returnType == null || !returnType.isPrimitive() || !returnType.isArray() || !returnType.isInterface()","rationale":"Ensures returnType can be any class but null and some type tests are important.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.779181491Z"}
{"id":"8165c303-cf0b-48ae-87f3-8a0ede55e3a0","expr":"emptyInstances.containsKey(returnType) || !emptyInstances.containsKey(returnType)","rationale":"emptyInstances can contain or not contain returnType key at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.779181491Z"}
{"id":"1e321f66-a4e1-4709-8a15-03b2a838b1b4","expr":"level <= 2 || level > 2","rationale":"level is nonnegative and the comparisons define branch conditions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.779181491Z"}
{"id":"5340b03b-7196-4d21-9081-d3f385862f2a","expr":"obj != null && interfaceClazzName != null && obj.getClass() != null && !interfaceClazzName.isEmpty()","rationale":"obj and interfaceClazzName must be non-null for the method logic to proceed meaningfully, and interfaceClazzName should be non-empty to correspond to a valid class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.783630423Z"}
{"id":"d4c5ad7a-493d-41da-9b9e-e850cca5cd1c","expr":"obj.getClass().isInstance(obj)","rationale":"By Java definition, obj is an instance of its own class, so this holds true.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.783630423Z"}
{"id":"ddcc0df7-8a5c-44bd-855d-7fddfbfd3216","expr":"(obj != null) == (interfaceClazzName != null) || (interfaceClazzName == null && obj == null)","rationale":"If obj or interfaceClazzName is null, it affects method behavior, so tracking nullity relation between both parameters is meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.783630423Z"}
{"id":"f27251de-ce73-474f-a665-df1d53a9a654","expr":"(level > 2) == (result == null)","rationale":"When level > 2, result must be null according to the first check in the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.796058834Z"}
{"id":"3812d02f-6674-4705-aa6a-092a3409b0a9","expr":"returnType != null || result == null","rationale":"If returnType is null, the method returns null immediately.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.796058834Z"}
{"id":"1bf918df-ddf6-4288-be5e-21b032100811","expr":"(returnType.isArray() == (result != null && result.getClass().isArray()))","rationale":"Result is an empty array when returnType is an array class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.796058834Z"}
{"id":"4dc24bb0-9bc0-4644-9fda-6df0967e05be","expr":"result == null || m.getReturnType().isPrimitive()","rationale":"Result is only non-null when return type is primitive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Method):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.801428865Z"}
{"id":"6c31ca06-e465-44e9-8248-c9aaaaf3977c","expr":"!m.getReturnType().isPrimitive() || result != null","rationale":"Primitive return types yield non-null default values.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Method):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.801428865Z"}
{"id":"160c9664-e18f-4fa0-acb0-5507fba8b505","expr":"returnType != null","rationale":"The parameter returnType should not be null at method entry to create an empty object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.803402943Z"}
{"id":"9810e031-4e4b-45a4-bbe3-6587b38a6850","expr":"returnType.isPrimitive() || !returnType.isPrimitive()","rationale":"returnType is either a primitive type or not, covering all class possibilities.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.803402943Z"}
{"id":"62910fee-9305-4951-8745-17830c6b61bf","expr":"result != null || returnType == null","rationale":"Since the method returns an object based on returnType, if the result is null then returnType may be null. Otherwise, result is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.803921542Z"}
{"id":"a3e53b31-c59f-4e18-97b1-f3a8606ae031","expr":"result == null || returnType.isInstance(result)","rationale":"The returned object should be compatible with the requested returnType.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.803921542Z"}
{"id":"18df0f58-5c51-46cd-92cb-ad8c0d7fbe87","expr":"(classType != null && classType.isPrimitive()) || result == null","rationale":"If classType is primitive, result is from primitiveDefaults; else result is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.820580753Z"}
{"id":"049f73ba-5397-47a9-b250-7c90187dc363","expr":"classType == null || !classType.isPrimitive() || result != null","rationale":"If classType is primitive, result is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.820580753Z"}
{"id":"27409036-f9b8-4dbd-bc6e-abd466615923","expr":"m.getReturnType().isPrimitive() || !m.getReturnType().isPrimitive()","rationale":"The return type of method m is either primitive or not; this expresses the exhaustive cases.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Method):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.830048964Z"}
{"id":"b71b0a15-b638-4483-9323-ac9ff5d3135b","expr":"(!m.getReturnType().isPrimitive() || m.getReturnType().isPrimitive())","rationale":"This expression highlights that either the return type is primitive or not, which aligns with code logic.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Method):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.830048964Z"}
{"id":"91195413-c041-41f1-a2f3-4ac9b3623926","expr":"classType == null || classType.isPrimitive() || !classType.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Captures the three possible states of classType relevant to the method: null, primitive, or non-primitive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:02.844820640Z"}
