{"id":"a7b71cd6-2fdb-4ed0-9111-015e69bb5178","expr":"logger == null || logger.isErrorEnabled() == false || logger != null","rationale":"If logger is null, method returns immediately, otherwise logger may have error enabled or not. This captures control flow and state relationship.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.241045412Z"}
{"id":"d6e078ef-7c2b-4554-a3f5-522ad8c312f2","expr":"logger != null && !logger.isErrorEnabled() || (logger.isErrorEnabled() && e != null)","rationale":"When logger is not null and error is enabled, the throwable e tends to be non-null, indicating the method logs an error with an exception.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.242378350Z"}
{"id":"e78cd23b-4e53-465c-b693-247227e97442","expr":"logger != null || msg == null","rationale":"If logger is null, the method returns early; msg can be null then.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.240710059Z"}
