{"id":"2e023406-63de-4836-b52d-2add27118eb0","expr":"logger == null || logger.isErrorEnabled() || !logger.isErrorEnabled()","rationale":"This is tautological due to logical disjunction.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.242378350Z"}
{"id":"9b26b273-062a-4639-be85-bf2dac6b032b","expr":"!(logger != null && logger.isErrorEnabled()) || e == null || msg != null","rationale":"At error level enabled, either exception is null or message is not null to provide information.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.242378350Z"}
{"id":"89739d04-1eb7-4995-897b-332b61781afa","expr":"logger != null && logger.isErrorEnabled() || e == null","rationale":"When error logging doesn't proceed, exception e tends to be null or irrelevant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.242378350Z"}
{"id":"d5669e89-ee77-46b6-87e1-25e88a9cae20","expr":"logger != null || msg == null || e == null","rationale":"If logger is null, the method returns immediately, so no further checks are needed. Otherwise, msg and e might be non-null or null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.241532201Z"}
