{"id":"392c65e4-0077-4bca-8456-e9787fcc99e8","expr":"logger != null || !logger.isErrorEnabled() || e != null || msg != null","rationale":"Different nullness combinations for inputs when logger may or may not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#error(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.241532201Z"}
{"id":"8140e198-6488-4cbc-82f0-c1d57c5acc23","expr":"result <= 0 || result >= 0","rationale":"result must be an int indicating order, so it's always less than, equal to, or greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodComparator#compare(Method,Method):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodComparator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.243827215Z"}
{"id":"c28ace20-18f0-49a6-92bb-0e74db8e8698","expr":"(result == 0) == m1.equals(m2)","rationale":"The compare method returns 0 if and only if the methods are equal, per the first comparison check.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodComparator#compare(Method,Method):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodComparator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.243827215Z"}
