{"id":"ae62757e-52fb-4210-82aa-ef74db46c99d","expr":"m1.getParameterTypes() != null && m2.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"The method accesses the parameter types arrays, so these references must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodComparator#compare(Method,Method):int","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodComparator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T02:17:04.242787031Z"}
